    "text color" : "[0.0667, 0.0667, 0.0667]",
    "content" : "We followed 240 participants aged eight to twelve for two academic years. Each session lasted forty minutes and was recorded with the consent of the parents. Eye movements were tracked at 500 Hz. Language assessments were administered three times per year and scored by two independent raters who were blind to the experimental condition."
