    "font size" : 10.995,
    "text color" : "[0.0667, 0.0667, 0.0667]",
    "content" : "Previous work by Dr. Smith et al. showed measurable gains after twelve weeks of daily practice. However, the underlying mechanisms remain poorly understood. Section 2 describes the methods that were used to collect and analyze the data."
