    "font size" : 10.995,
    "text color" : "[0.0667, 0.0667, 0.0667]",
    "content" : "Reading is a complex cognitive activity that involves multiple brain regions. In this paper, we review recent evidence from longitudinal studies of children and discuss how structured reading practice shapes neural circuits over time."
